   "search_text": "3. In an acute, non-isosceles triangle 𝐴𝐵𝐶the midpoints of 𝐴𝐶and 𝐴𝐵are\n  𝐵1 and 𝐶1 respectively. A point 𝐷lies on 𝐵𝐶with 𝐶between 𝐵and 𝐷.\n  The point 𝐹is such that ∠𝐴𝐹𝐶is a right angle and ∠𝐷𝐶𝐹= ∠𝐹𝐶𝐴. The\n   point 𝐺is such that ∠𝐴𝐺𝐵is a right angle and ∠𝐶𝐵𝐺= ∠𝐺𝐵𝐴. Prove that\n   𝐵1, 𝐶1, 𝐹and 𝐺are collinear.\n",
